      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "The salesman was thorough and welcomed all questions and had all the answers i wanted.I did alot of research online. The regular communication was faultless, they kept me updated constantly. The time frame from ordering to receiving was very small, maybe a month.Absolutely all equipment was delivered a week before the install date, at this point still only a deposit was paid, and a team of installers came two days early to install. Etsa takes the longest, Clewers started the ball rolling with them from day one, but i still need to wait 3 more weeks for them, but the hard part is done. very impressed.",
