      "review_date_formatted": "",
      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Clewers in Clare won my business after receiving quotes from three other sources, one of which was Origin, their quote being very competitive for the 1.5kW system, but not as good for the 2kW system.  Clewers also offered more options of systems than any of the other three and explained the RECs facts in more detail.  However, having Red Energy as my current retail supplier, they do not yet recognise solar power in SA, therefore I have to change over to a retail supplier that does.  I received quotes from AGL and Origin and decided on Origin and expect the solar system to be installed about mid February.  One other factor offered by both Origin and Clewers for the cost of the system and installation in their quote can be paid off over 12 months interest free and putting a 10% deposit down (the balance payment starting when the system is installed).",
